# SYNTAX TEST "text.html.tiddlywiki5" "A call standing in a list item or heading ends at a blank line"

# A list item, a quote line, a term, a definition and a heading each end at their newline, and a
# call opened in one that never closes ran the rest of the file as its arguments. TiddlyWiki
# builds a call across a blank line, so a bail costs a reading the host keeps; measured over
# 5891 TiddlyWiki tiddlers, 790 memes and this corpus, 0 of 2535 calls standing in such a line
# cross a blank line between their parameters, and the two that cross do so inside a quoted
# value, which the bail never reaches. So the call stops at a blank line here, and only here.

* <<m a="x" b=

A paragraph after the open call.
#^^^^^^^^^ text.html.tiddlywiki5 meta.paragraph.tiddlywiki5
#^^^^^^^^^ - meta.variable.call.parameters.tiddlywiki5

# <<m a="x" b=

A paragraph after the open call.
#^^^^^^^^^ text.html.tiddlywiki5 meta.paragraph.tiddlywiki5
#^^^^^^^^^ - meta.variable.call.parameters.tiddlywiki5

> <<m a="x" b=

A paragraph after the open call.
#^^^^^^^^^ text.html.tiddlywiki5 meta.paragraph.tiddlywiki5
#^^^^^^^^^ - meta.variable.call.parameters.tiddlywiki5

; <<m a="x" b=

A paragraph after the open call.
#^^^^^^^^^ text.html.tiddlywiki5 meta.paragraph.tiddlywiki5
#^^^^^^^^^ - meta.variable.call.parameters.tiddlywiki5

: <<m a="x" b=

A paragraph after the open call.
#^^^^^^^^^ text.html.tiddlywiki5 meta.paragraph.tiddlywiki5
#^^^^^^^^^ - meta.variable.call.parameters.tiddlywiki5

! <<m a="x" b=

A paragraph after the open call.
#^^^^^^^^^ text.html.tiddlywiki5 meta.paragraph.tiddlywiki5
#^^^^^^^^^ - meta.variable.call.parameters.tiddlywiki5

# CONTROL: a value crossing a blank line keeps its call; the bail never reaches inside a string.

* <<m a="x

y">>

A paragraph after the closed call.
#^^^^^^^^^ text.html.tiddlywiki5 meta.paragraph.tiddlywiki5
#^^^^^^^^^ - meta.variable.call.parameters.tiddlywiki5

# CONTROL: a call in a paragraph still crosses a blank line, as TiddlyWiki builds it.

x <<m

>>
#^^ text.html.tiddlywiki5 meta.paragraph.tiddlywiki5 meta.variable.call.inline.tiddlywiki5 meta.variable.procedurecallinline.tiddlywiki5 punctuation.definition.procedurecallinline.end.tiddlywiki5
